### Root
GET http://localhost:8787/

### Health (root)
GET http://localhost:8787/health

### Health (API prefix)
GET http://localhost:8787/api/v1/health

### Register
POST http://localhost:8787/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "buddy@zentroverse.com",
  "password": "Zentroflow@2026",
  "name": "Buddy"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:8787/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "buddy@zentroverse.com",
  "password": "Zentroflow@2026"
}

### Create customer
POST http://localhost:8787/api/v1/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "ABC Logistics",
  "mobile": "9988776655",
  "email": "ops@abc.in",
  "address": "Chennai"
}

### List opportunities
GET http://localhost:8787/api/v1/opportunities?page=1&limit=20

### Validate import (JSON rows — no file)
POST http://localhost:8787/api/v1/leads/import/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rows": [
    {
      "customerName": "ABC Logistics",
      "mobile": "9988776655",
      "product": "Tata Ace",
      "requirement": "Standard",
      "district": "Chennai",
      "source": "Walk-in",
      "branch": "Chennai Central",
      "executive": "Sales Executive"
    }
  ]
}

### Generate IDs (JSON)
POST http://localhost:8787/api/v1/leads/import/generate-ids
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rows": [
    {
      "customerName": "ABC Logistics",
      "mobile": "9988776655",
      "product": "Tata Ace",
      "requirement": "Standard"
    }
  ]
}

### Last import batch
GET http://localhost:8787/api/v1/leads/import/latest

### Download template
GET http://localhost:8787/api/v1/leads/import/template

